content:
For the refund of a duplicate payment on the first installment of a new fee-bearing TRICARE Prime enrollment, the first installment's value is set by its frequency:

- **monthly first installment** - one twelfth of the annual fee of the enrollment's fee arrangement (the annual fee divided by 12), rounded to the cent;
- **quarterly first installment** - one quarter of that fee (the annual fee divided by 4), rounded to the cent;
- **otherwise** - the whole annual fee.

**Basis Q&A.** *Which annual fee?* The tier's annual individual fee for an individual arrangement, its annual family fee for a family arrangement. *A quarterly first installment of a TRICARE Prime Retiree Group A individual arrangement (390.12)?* 97.53. *A monthly one?* 32.51. *An annual one?* 390.12.

Payments of 97.53 and 97.53 against a quarterly first installment of that arrangement exceed its value by 97.53.
